Shang Zhitao.

20
00:04:24,840 --> 00:04:28,200
Your eyebrows. Why do you always frown?

21
00:04:28,920 --> 00:04:30,080
Are you tired?

22
00:04:38,360 --> 00:04:39,400
Come home with me.

23
00:04:57,040 --> 00:04:58,120
What's going on?

24
00:04:59,920 --> 00:05:00,760
Come on. Give it to me.

25
00:05:04,600 --> 00:05:06,040
Nothing. It's…

26
00:05:06,720 --> 00:05:08,200
I sprained my ankle.

27
00:05:08,800 --> 00:05:09,680
Is it serious?

28
00:05:09,760 --> 00:05:10,920
- Do you need to go to the hospital?
- It's not.

29
00:05:11,000 --> 00:05:12,080
It's fine. No need to go to the hospital.

30
00:05:15,720 --> 00:05:16,640
What happened?

31
00:05:18,200 --> 00:05:19,720
Today

32
00:05:21,200 --> 00:05:23,560
isn't my day.

33
00:05:28,280 --> 00:05:29,400
The event was ruined.

34
00:05:30,560 --> 00:05:34,040
One of our customers
already has a boyfriend,

35
00:05:34,120 --> 00:05:36,360
but she still joined our event.

36
00:05:37,120 --> 00:05:38,120
In the end,

37
00:05:38,640 --> 00:05:43,160
her boyfriend came to the venue
and made a mess out of it.

38
00:05:43,680 --> 00:05:46,880
I wanted to say something to comfort her,

39
00:05:46,960 --> 00:05:51,520
but she pushed me down on the ground.

40
00:05:52,120 --> 00:05:55,880
I sprained my ankle, and it hurts.

41
00:06:08,080 --> 00:06:09,320
Don't catch a cold.

42
00:06:10,360 --> 00:06:11,400
Go back first.

43
00:06:17,120 --> 00:06:17,960
Let's go.

44
00:06:21,360 --> 00:06:23,800
- Did I get it dirty?
- It's fine. Slow down.

45
00:06:29,640 --> 00:06:31,080
Give me a hand.

46
00:06:33,360 --> 00:06:34,200
Come.

47
00:06:50,080 --> 00:06:51,160
Come inside.

48
00:06:54,600 --> 00:06:55,440
Fish.

49
00:06:57,840 --> 00:06:58,800
Come here.

50
00:07:38,960 --> 00:07:39,800
Hello?

51
00:07:40,480 --> 00:07:42,000
Where are you?

52
00:07:42,080 --> 00:07:44,160
We are going to the next place now.

53
00:07:44,240 --> 00:07:45,240
We want to keep drinking at your home.

54
00:07:45,320 --> 00:07:46,600
Luan Nian, we are going to your home.

55
00:07:46,680 --> 00:07:48,600
We are going to keep celebrating!

56
00:07:48,680 --> 00:07:49,920
Don't come.

57
00:07:50,000 --> 00:07:51,040
Go back to your own homes.

58
00:07:51,120 --> 00:07:52,360
I don't welcome anyone.

59
00:08:10,760 --> 00:08:11,600
SUN YUANZHU

60
00:08:26,600 --> 00:08:27,560
She's still not answering?

61
00:09:25,760 --> 00:09:26,800
Luan Nian?

62
00:09:30,240 --> 00:09:31,200
Luke.

63
00:09:32,040 --> 00:09:33,160
Where am I?

64
00:09:34,240 --> 00:09:35,240
This is my house.

65
00:09:46,680 --> 00:09:47,520
Thank you.

66
00:09:49,520 --> 00:09:52,360
You were drunk
and couldn't say your address clearly.

67
00:09:53,080 --> 00:09:54,760
I had to bring you here

68
00:09:54,840 --> 00:09:57,280
and wait for you to sober up
before sending you home.

69
00:10:06,440 --> 00:10:09,360
Sorry for troubling you.

70
00:10:09,920 --> 00:10:11,320
Did I embarrass myself

71
00:10:12,560 --> 00:10:14,000
when I was drunk?

72
00:10:15,760 --> 00:10:16,600
You did.

73
00:10:27,400 --> 00:10:30,560
You spouted nonsense and confessed to me.

74
00:10:32,240 --> 00:10:34,000
You wanted me to marry you.

75
00:10:34,880 --> 00:10:37,240
Don't… Don't believe anything I said.

76
00:10:37,320 --> 00:10:41,840
They say the words you say
when you're drunk are all nonsense.

77
00:10:42,440 --> 00:10:44,920
When I am sober,
I've never thought about this.

78
00:10:51,840 --> 00:10:53,000
Are you single?

79
00:10:57,200 --> 00:10:58,240
Yes.

80
00:11:00,120 --> 00:11:01,240
Why don't we give it a try?

81
00:11:05,560 --> 00:11:06,760
No…

82
00:11:06,840 --> 00:11:08,000
There's no need.

83
00:11:08,960 --> 00:11:10,200
When it comes to thoughts

84
00:11:11,760 --> 00:11:14,280
that I shouldn't be having,
I can control them really well.

85
00:11:28,600 --> 00:11:31,120
Can you control the feeling of love?

86
00:11:42,120 --> 00:11:43,640
I'm going to the toilet.

87
00:12:15,480 --> 00:12:16,720
Are you going to my room?

88
00:12:21,080 --> 00:12:22,120
The toilet is on the right.

89
00:13:48,640 --> 00:13:50,000
Get changed.

90
00:13:50,080 --> 00:13:51,160
You'll feel more comfortable.

91
00:13:52,280 --> 00:13:53,440
Thank you.

92
00:14:08,000 --> 00:14:11,440
LONG ZHENTIAN

93
00:14:11,520 --> 00:14:13,440
Zhentian. Are you guys still outside?

94
00:14:13,520 --> 00:14:14,960
I went home.

95
00:14:15,040 --> 00:14:20,120
Shang Zhitao met someone called Luke
at the bar a few hours ago.

96
00:14:20,200 --> 00:14:21,760
He asked her to work overtime.

97
00:14:21,840 --> 00:14:23,000
Work overtime?

98
00:14:23,080 --> 00:14:27,640
Yes. It was very unreasonable,
but Flora agreed.

99
00:14:28,400 --> 00:14:30,720
All right. Rest early.

100
00:14:48,320 --> 00:14:50,360
We're in the same boat.

101
00:14:50,880 --> 00:14:52,080
Let me dress the wound for you.

102
00:14:52,760 --> 00:14:54,760
I've been dreaming about you lately.

103
00:14:54,840 --> 00:14:57,680
In ancient times, you'd have to…

104
00:14:58,920 --> 00:15:00,680
Marry me.

105
00:16:50,160 --> 00:16:51,200
Have you finally realized?

106
00:16:52,400 --> 00:16:54,000
You can't control the feeling of love.

107
00:17:07,520 --> 00:17:09,119
Your phone has been ringing all night.

108
00:17:10,040 --> 00:17:11,079
Answer it.

109
00:17:15,960 --> 00:17:17,119
- Hi, Sun Yu.
- Tao.

110
00:17:17,760 --> 00:17:18,839
You scared me.

111
00:17:18,920 --> 00:17:21,079
Sun Yuanzhu and I
almost called the police.

112
00:17:21,160 --> 00:17:22,720
Where are you? We'll go pick you up.

113
00:17:23,520 --> 00:17:24,599
No need.

114
00:17:25,200 --> 00:17:26,440
I can go back on my own.

115
00:17:27,280 --> 00:17:28,440
I'll take you home later.

116
00:17:30,000 --> 00:17:32,160
Why do I hear a man's voice?

117
00:17:32,880 --> 00:17:34,440
Tao, are you safe?

118
00:17:34,520 --> 00:17:35,600
You must be safe.

119
00:17:36,120 --> 00:17:37,080
If you are in danger,

120
00:17:37,160 --> 00:17:38,080
- I'm safe.
- tap the phone.

121
00:17:39,280 --> 00:17:40,880
I'm very safe.

122
00:17:40,960 --> 00:17:43,640
Long Zhentian said a man called Luke

123
00:17:43,720 --> 00:17:47,400
took you away when you were at the bar.

124
00:17:47,480 --> 00:17:50,000
Is Luke Luan Nian?

125
00:17:56,280 --> 00:17:57,240
It's him.

126
00:17:57,320 --> 00:17:58,240
Got it.

127
00:17:58,320 --> 00:18:00,240
The rain is heavy outside.
It'll be hard to get a taxi.

128
00:18:00,320 --> 00:18:03,040
If you're coming back tomorrow,
remember to stay safe

129
00:18:03,120 --> 00:18:04,120
and protect yourself.

130
00:18:04,200 --> 00:18:05,400
All right. I'm hanging up.

131
00:18:16,080 --> 00:18:16,920
Are you going back?

132
00:18:19,840 --> 00:18:21,480
It's raining outside.
You can't get a taxi easily.

133
00:18:22,120 --> 00:18:23,360
I drank, so I can't drive.

134
00:18:24,480 --> 00:18:25,480
Besides, your friend said

135
00:18:26,440 --> 00:18:27,800
it'd be troublesome
to get a taxi when it was raining.

136
00:18:27,880 --> 00:18:29,480
You can go back tomorrow.

137
00:18:36,760 --> 00:18:37,680
Sure.

138
00:18:42,120 --> 00:18:43,120
Shang Zhitao,

139
00:18:45,800 --> 00:18:47,360
are you sober now?

140
00:18:50,520 --> 00:18:52,320
Do you know what will happen next?

141
00:22:27,320 --> 00:22:28,400
Thanks for last night.

142
00:22:43,960 --> 00:22:45,400
Welcome to the weather forecast.

143
00:22:45,480 --> 00:22:48,200
Today is April 12th, 2013.

144
00:22:48,280 --> 00:22:50,040
Beijing is cloudy, but turning clear.

145
00:22:50,120 --> 00:22:52,720
The temperature is around
23 degrees Celsius.

146
00:22:52,800 --> 00:22:55,800
Last night's storm brought
a good amount of nutrients to plants.

147
00:22:55,880 --> 00:22:58,400
