148
00:23:32,040 --> 00:23:33,960
LUAN NIAN: IT'S NOTHING MUCH

149
00:23:39,360 --> 00:23:40,400
Hello.

150
00:23:51,240 --> 00:23:52,480
Is she from 2501?

151
00:23:53,320 --> 00:23:54,520
It's none of your business.

152
00:23:55,200 --> 00:23:56,040
Get back in your position.

153
00:24:16,680 --> 00:24:18,400
Today's weather sure is nice.

154
00:24:18,480 --> 00:24:20,040
The sun is shining brightly.

155
00:24:27,760 --> 00:24:28,720
Yes.

156
00:24:30,200 --> 00:24:31,520
How can the morning sun

157
00:24:33,400 --> 00:24:34,960
be so pretty?

158
00:25:40,040 --> 00:25:40,880
Great.

159
00:25:41,480 --> 00:25:42,680
You're giving me the silent treatment.

160
00:25:47,880 --> 00:25:49,480
You're a jerk.

161
00:25:49,560 --> 00:25:51,160
Why did you leave in a rush yesterday?

162
00:25:51,240 --> 00:25:53,960
You didn't even take your jacket
or drive your car.

163
00:25:54,480 --> 00:25:56,160
I had to deliver them to you.

164
00:26:23,040 --> 00:26:23,960
You're back.

165
00:26:31,480 --> 00:26:33,440
You're quite open-minded, Shang Zhitao.

166
00:26:33,520 --> 00:26:34,800
It was an accident.

167
00:26:35,400 --> 00:26:37,000
I know it was an accident for you.

168
00:26:37,520 --> 00:26:39,040
What about Luan Nian?

169
00:26:39,120 --> 00:26:40,360
Was it the same for him?

170
00:26:40,920 --> 00:26:42,160
I guess it counts as an accident.

171
00:26:43,880 --> 00:26:45,200
That's great.

172
00:26:46,080 --> 00:26:48,840
Men and women in this city
have happy accidents every day.

173
00:26:48,920 --> 00:26:49,840
It's a good thing.

174
00:26:49,920 --> 00:26:51,880
My hunch is always accurate.

175
00:26:51,960 --> 00:26:55,320
When you first
brought that girl to my place,

176
00:26:55,400 --> 00:26:58,640
I knew there would be a spark
between you two.

177
00:26:58,720 --> 00:27:00,640
You must have been planning this
for a long time.

178
00:27:00,720 --> 00:27:04,840
He first saved your life
and then created an accident.

179
00:27:04,920 --> 00:27:05,800
In my opinion,

180
00:27:05,880 --> 00:27:09,520
he has been advancing step by step
for a long time.

181
00:27:11,040 --> 00:27:13,480
Don't make it sound like he's a jerk.

182
00:27:13,560 --> 00:27:15,320
I still respect him a lot.

183
00:27:15,400 --> 00:27:16,960
Respect? What kind of respect?

184
00:27:17,040 --> 00:27:18,680
Bowing to him on the bed?

185
00:27:18,760 --> 00:27:19,600
Enough…

186
00:27:21,200 --> 00:27:23,360
I have no interest in spending time
and energy to date someone.

187
00:27:23,960 --> 00:27:25,600
You don't date people, indeed.

188
00:27:25,680 --> 00:27:27,120
Girls are the ones
throwing themselves at you.

189
00:27:31,520 --> 00:27:33,680
She's really not the type
to throw herself at someone.

190
00:27:40,320 --> 00:27:42,160
Then you've got to tell me about that.

191
00:27:44,880 --> 00:27:47,840
So, what kind of person is she?

192
00:27:49,400 --> 00:27:51,160
Even among us,
people can be very different.

193
00:27:51,240 --> 00:27:54,840
The ideas he comes up with in 0.1 seconds
can satisfy the clients.

194
00:27:55,800 --> 00:27:56,920
He is talented

195
00:27:57,000 --> 00:28:00,760
and has become an expert in this industry
at such a young age.

196
00:28:00,840 --> 00:28:04,040
Any ordinary person
will need ten years, at least,

197
00:28:04,120 --> 00:28:05,920
to reach his position.

198
00:28:06,000 --> 00:28:07,760
I get it now.

199
00:28:07,840 --> 00:28:10,560
Men who are outstanding at work
are indeed charming.

200
00:28:12,960 --> 00:28:14,760
What about his life?
How is his private life?

201
00:28:23,840 --> 00:28:26,680
I think he's a bit lonely.

202
00:28:29,240 --> 00:28:31,840
Shang Zhitao, you're done for.

203
00:28:32,880 --> 00:28:34,760
When you unknowingly feel sorry for a man,

204
00:28:34,840 --> 00:28:38,080
it's the beginning
of falling wholeheartedly in love.

205
00:28:38,600 --> 00:28:43,160
I really think Ms. Shang
is different from all those girls

206
00:28:43,240 --> 00:28:46,680
who fawned over you
and flattered you in the past.

207
00:28:46,760 --> 00:28:49,080
She seems kind and pure.

208
00:28:49,160 --> 00:28:50,680
If you two are meant for each other,

209
00:28:50,760 --> 00:28:52,840
don't stick to your outdated beliefs.

210
00:28:52,920 --> 00:28:55,840
Let go of your past prejudices
and try dating her.

211
00:28:55,920 --> 00:28:57,760
That's your prejudice against me.

212
00:28:59,000 --> 00:29:00,840
In your opinion, am I evil or am I a jerk?

213
00:29:01,960 --> 00:29:04,000
I wish you were a jerk.

214
00:29:04,520 --> 00:29:06,720
You need to know your true self.

215
00:29:06,800 --> 00:29:08,720
You are just an arrogant, silly,
and oblivious guy.

216
00:29:10,040 --> 00:29:11,960
Once a girl starts clinging to you,

217
00:29:12,040 --> 00:29:13,960
you immediately turn into
a heartless man who needs no love.

218
00:29:16,120 --> 00:29:17,800
Listen to me.

219
00:29:17,880 --> 00:29:20,480
Love at first sight
or love that never fades

220
00:29:20,560 --> 00:29:21,880
doesn't exist in this world.

221
00:29:22,440 --> 00:29:23,280
Wake up.

222
00:29:23,360 --> 00:29:24,800
Get lost.

223
00:29:26,160 --> 00:29:28,040
Fine. I still have something to do
at my restaurant.

224
00:29:28,120 --> 00:29:29,280
I won't disturb you anymore.

225
00:29:30,400 --> 00:29:31,360
I'm leaving.

226
00:29:35,600 --> 00:29:37,920
Whose… Whose bag is this?

227
00:29:40,040 --> 00:29:40,960
Just leave it there.

228
00:29:44,200 --> 00:29:46,040
Ms. Shang purposely left it here.

229
00:29:46,120 --> 00:29:47,640
She's playing hard to get.

230
00:29:48,240 --> 00:29:49,600
Take your chance when you need to.

231
00:29:50,600 --> 00:29:51,480
Go for it.

232
00:29:52,120 --> 00:29:52,960
I'm leaving.

233
00:30:08,320 --> 00:30:09,200
LUAN NIAN

234
00:30:13,320 --> 00:30:14,920
Answer it. Answer it.

235
00:30:18,840 --> 00:30:19,720
It's Luke.

236
00:30:19,800 --> 00:30:20,640
Where are you?

237
00:30:21,960 --> 00:30:22,840
I'm home.

238
00:30:24,640 --> 00:30:25,840
I'll come find you tonight.

239
00:30:26,600 --> 00:30:27,680
Sure.

240
00:30:30,240 --> 00:30:31,760
What did he say?

241
00:30:32,360 --> 00:30:33,760
He said

242
00:30:35,080 --> 00:30:36,480
he'd come find me tonight.

243
00:30:39,360 --> 00:30:40,720
He's going to confess.

244
00:30:42,400 --> 00:30:44,520
I don't think so.

245
00:30:44,600 --> 00:30:47,800
Regardless, you must
put on full makeup tonight.

246
00:30:47,880 --> 00:30:50,080
Even if you're just taking a stroll,
you must look pretty.

247
00:30:50,160 --> 00:30:51,560
Go. Get changed.

248
00:30:51,640 --> 00:30:52,680
Hurry up.

249
00:30:53,320 --> 00:30:54,600
Stop wasting time.

250
00:31:49,920 --> 00:31:51,240
You've put on makeup.

251
00:31:57,840 --> 00:31:59,680
Why did you ask to meet up?

252
00:32:03,200 --> 00:32:04,320
Are you sober now?

253
00:32:11,960 --> 00:32:13,240
You left your bag at my place.

254
00:32:15,680 --> 00:32:16,760
I forgot.

255
00:32:17,480 --> 00:32:18,720
Thanks.

256
00:32:22,240 --> 00:32:23,400
Sorry.

257
00:32:23,480 --> 00:32:26,120
I made you come all the way here
to return my bag.

258
00:32:26,760 --> 00:32:28,480
Ms. Shang purposely left it here.

259
00:32:28,560 --> 00:32:29,520
She's playing hard to get.

260
00:32:31,440 --> 00:32:33,040
You purposely left your bag at my place

261
00:32:33,120 --> 00:32:34,600
so I'd come and find you.

262
00:32:39,800 --> 00:32:40,760
It wasn't on purpose.

263
00:32:44,800 --> 00:32:46,360
Are you worried that I'd cling to you?

264
00:32:57,480 --> 00:32:58,640
Don't worry.

265
00:32:59,480 --> 00:33:02,800
Last night was just an accident
between two adults.

266
00:33:03,600 --> 00:33:05,680
Thank you again for coming here
to return my bag.

267
00:33:06,440 --> 00:33:07,480
I'm going back.

268
00:33:59,320 --> 00:34:02,680
You purposely left your bag at my place
so I'd come and find you.

269
00:34:20,920 --> 00:34:23,000
Why… Why are you back so soon?

270
00:34:27,760 --> 00:34:29,199
What happened?

271
00:34:37,199 --> 00:34:38,760
I left my bag at his place.

272
00:34:38,840 --> 00:34:40,239
He came to return it.

273
00:34:42,800 --> 00:34:44,639
And he told me

274
00:34:46,080 --> 00:34:47,880
not to get the wrong idea.

275
00:34:51,080 --> 00:34:52,239
What a jerk.

276
00:34:52,320 --> 00:34:53,280
I…

277
00:35:02,160 --> 00:35:03,480
What's done is done.

278
00:35:03,560 --> 00:35:05,040
Stop thinking about it.

279
00:35:05,560 --> 00:35:07,880
People make rash decisions all the time.

280
00:35:08,440 --> 00:35:11,200
He takes advantage of his good looks,
so he sees women as his prey.

281
00:35:11,280 --> 00:35:13,280
Just stay away from him in the future.

282
00:35:15,640 --> 00:35:16,480
Look at me.

283
00:35:16,560 --> 00:35:19,840
Do you know
the three golden rules of modern love?

284
00:35:23,440 --> 00:35:24,840
Don't ask about the past.

285
00:35:25,520 --> 00:35:26,680
Don't gamble on the future.

286
00:35:26,760 --> 00:35:28,800
Cherish the present.

287
00:35:31,480 --> 00:35:33,640
I overestimated myself.

288
00:35:34,280 --> 00:35:38,000
He and I are not from the same world.

289
00:35:41,040 --> 00:35:42,600
I still fell for it.

290
00:35:43,640 --> 00:35:48,120
I didn't want to hear it from him,
so I said it was an accident yesterday.

291
00:35:52,640 --> 00:35:54,120
When it comes to love,

292
00:35:54,800 --> 00:35:57,000
no one is right or wrong.

293
00:35:57,600 --> 00:35:59,280
You think he's experienced,

294
00:35:59,800 --> 00:36:02,880
but he might have gotten hurt once
by a woman as well.

295
00:36:03,800 --> 00:36:04,920
Probably.

296
00:36:07,080 --> 00:36:10,000
I'm just a passerby in his love life.

297
00:36:10,080 --> 00:36:12,040
Tao, cheer up.

298
00:36:12,120 --> 00:36:14,080
Love isn't the only thing in life.

299
00:36:25,680 --> 00:36:27,680
I'll attend English lessons
starting tomorrow.

300
00:36:27,760 --> 00:36:29,440
I'm going to study and improve.

301
00:36:29,520 --> 00:36:30,640
That's right.

302
00:36:30,720 --> 00:36:32,480
Improve and study whenever you can.

303
00:36:32,560 --> 00:36:33,960
Focus on yourself.

304
00:36:34,040 --> 00:36:36,240
Don't let love sidetrack your ambition.

305
00:36:36,320 --> 00:36:38,240
I'm counting on you
to support me in the future.

306
00:36:38,800 --> 00:36:40,760
That's right. I want bread
for tomorrow morning.

307
00:36:40,840 --> 00:36:41,760
Bring some back after class.

308
00:36:42,360 --> 00:36:45,120
To repay you, I can introduce you
to some of our finest clients.

309
00:36:45,200 --> 00:36:47,280
Pick anyone you want.

310
00:36:47,360 --> 00:36:48,560
I don't need you to repay the favor.

311
00:36:48,640 --> 00:36:50,160
Of course I'll bring you bread.

312
00:36:51,760 --> 00:36:52,880
Sure.

313
00:36:59,560 --> 00:37:00,840
Bread is indeed…

314
00:37:04,240 --> 00:37:05,720
more important than love.

315
00:37:11,040 --> 00:37:12,680
You really are a silly and oblivious guy.

316
00:37:13,200 --> 00:37:15,000
I was just saying,
and you actually went and asked her.

317
00:37:15,720 --> 00:37:16,880
Hurry and go make it up to her.

318
00:37:24,720 --> 00:37:27,480
This bag I just sent you
is a limited-edition design.

319
00:37:27,560 --> 00:37:29,760
However, it's already
reserved for a customer.

320
00:37:29,840 --> 00:37:30,880
If you like it, I'll order it for you.

321
00:37:30,960 --> 00:37:32,040
I want this one.

322
00:37:32,120 --> 00:37:33,080
I want it today.

323
00:37:33,160 --> 00:37:35,000
Mr. Luan, this won't do.

324
00:37:35,520 --> 00:37:36,800
This one is for another customer.

325
00:37:36,880 --> 00:37:39,080
For this one, we need to allocate stock
before we can get it from another store.

326
00:37:39,160 --> 00:37:40,640
Do what you must.

327
00:37:40,720 --> 00:37:42,600
If I can get it by today,

328
00:37:42,680 --> 00:37:46,000
I'll buy out your shop's watches,
belts, and cutlery.

329
00:37:46,720 --> 00:37:47,560
I'll come pick them up later.

330
00:37:48,360 --> 00:37:50,160
Sure. I'll think of something.

331
00:37:50,240 --> 00:37:52,840
I'll get everything ready for you
and have someone deliver them to your car.

332
00:38:09,480 --> 00:38:12,040
THE NEXT TRAIN ARRIVES IN ONE MINUTE

333
00:38:19,400 --> 00:38:21,240
It means you gain wisdom
through experience.

334
00:38:48,120 --> 00:38:50,080
SUN YU: DON'T FORGET TO BUY BREAD

335
00:38:51,240 --> 00:38:53,760
Mr. Long, let's end the lesson here.

336
00:38:53,840 --> 00:38:54,680
I still have something to do.

337
00:38:56,280 --> 00:38:57,800
- Let me pay the bill.
- No.

338
00:38:57,880 --> 00:38:59,960
It's my treat today.
You taught me English today.

339
00:39:01,080 --> 00:39:02,760
Let me pay today.

340
00:39:02,840 --> 00:39:07,360
In the next lesson, you can tell me
more about Chinese allusions

341
00:39:07,440 --> 00:39:08,600
to pay me back.

342
00:39:08,680 --> 00:39:11,240
Sure. In the next lesson, I'll tell you

343
00:39:11,320 --> 00:39:13,280
a story about reciprocity
and returning kindness.

344
00:39:13,880 --> 00:39:15,280
I only know the phrase,

345
00:39:15,800 --> 00:39:18,880
"Don't bite the hand that feeds you."

346
00:39:18,960 --> 00:39:21,040
You know quite a lot.

347
00:39:21,120 --> 00:39:21,960
It's nothing much.

348
00:39:25,160 --> 00:39:27,360
HAPPINESS PASTRY

349
00:39:29,200 --> 00:39:30,480
BLACK TRUFFLE MUSHROOM BEEF PUFF
30.6 YUAN

350
00:39:30,560 --> 00:39:31,360
CHEESY CHICKEN BUN, 30.6 YUAN

351
00:39:31,440 --> 00:39:32,600
BIRTHDAY PARTY HAT

352
00:39:33,360 --> 00:39:34,840
Why are they so expensive?

353
00:39:38,800 --> 00:39:40,920
HALF PRICE AT 9 P.M. EVERY NIGHT

354
00:39:44,920 --> 00:39:46,280
SUN YU

355
00:39:50,920 --> 00:39:52,040
Sun Yu.

356
00:39:52,120 --> 00:39:54,880
The bread here is half price after nine.

357
00:39:54,960 --> 00:39:56,760
What do you want? I'll buy them for you.

358
00:39:59,560 --> 00:40:00,840
Sure.

359
00:40:04,320 --> 00:40:06,200
LUAN NIAN: ARE YOU STILL AT HOME?

360
00:40:20,280 --> 00:40:23,280
They say the heart is a narrow door.

361
00:40:23,360 --> 00:40:26,640
Once you get hurt,
it'll leave a crack that gets in the way.

362
00:40:28,280 --> 00:40:30,280
When your sincerity
is being taken lightly,

363
00:40:30,360 --> 00:40:32,280
it's worse than getting hurt physically.

364
00:40:32,800 --> 00:40:35,360
The soft thorn deep in my heart,

365
00:40:35,440 --> 00:40:36,920
once touched, brings embarrassment.

366
00:40:37,440 --> 00:40:39,560
Just thinking about it
makes me feel disheartened.

367
00:40:45,760 --> 00:40:46,800
Dear customers,

368
00:40:46,880 --> 00:40:49,800
our freshly baked bread
will be sold at half price soon.

369
00:40:49,880 --> 00:40:52,520
If you are interested,
please proceed to the bread area.

370
00:40:52,600 --> 00:40:53,480
HAPPINESS PASTRY

371
00:41:09,520 --> 00:41:10,400
Luke?

372
00:41:10,480 --> 00:41:11,640
Why are you here?

373
00:41:11,720 --> 00:41:13,280
Can I help you?

374
00:41:30,720 --> 00:41:31,560
It's for you.

375
00:41:42,920 --> 00:41:44,480
I don't need this.

376
00:41:46,280 --> 00:41:47,840
That bag of yours is too old.

377
00:41:47,920 --> 00:41:48,800
Use a new one.

378
00:41:50,760 --> 00:41:53,000
This bag is good enough.

379
00:41:53,080 --> 00:41:54,240
I don't need to change it.

380
00:41:55,080 --> 00:41:56,480
Don't worry.

381
00:41:57,600 --> 00:41:59,960
What happened two days ago
was an accident.

382
00:42:01,160 --> 00:42:02,160
You're afraid of being pestered.

383
00:42:02,960 --> 00:42:04,280
And I'm also quite busy.

384
00:42:07,320 --> 00:42:08,680
Is that what you think?

385
00:42:13,360 --> 00:42:15,360
There's nothing more to it.

386
00:42:16,080 --> 00:42:17,240
Don't worry.

387
00:42:17,320 --> 00:42:19,080
I'm a pragmatist.

388
00:42:19,160 --> 00:42:21,400
Between work and love,
I'll surely choose work.

389
00:42:23,560 --> 00:42:24,480
In the future,

390
00:42:25,720 --> 00:42:26,880
let's just…

391
00:42:30,520 --> 00:42:32,240
forget this ever happened.

392
00:42:32,320 --> 00:42:33,680
Let's just be strangers.

393
00:42:35,760 --> 00:42:36,880
You care a lot about this job.

394
00:42:38,960 --> 00:42:39,800
Of course.

395
00:42:40,840 --> 00:42:44,600
I hope this incident
won't affect your opinion of my work.

396
00:42:45,720 --> 00:42:46,640
It won't.

397
00:42:51,440 --> 00:42:52,360
That's good to hear.

398
00:42:56,480 --> 00:42:57,520
You may go back.

399
00:42:58,240 --> 00:43:00,800
This bag is too expensive.
It's not suitable for me.

400
00:43:04,280 --> 00:43:07,760
So even without accepting the bag,
you still want to date me?

401
00:43:28,400 --> 00:43:29,800
We are…

402
00:43:32,760 --> 00:43:35,280
not in an official relationship.

403
00:43:36,840 --> 00:43:37,680
Tao…

404
00:43:39,000 --> 00:43:43,200
What is an official relationship
in this day and age?

405
00:43:43,280 --> 00:43:46,600
A sincere promise or a fake confession?

406
00:43:46,680 --> 00:43:49,280
Love is always complicated.

407
00:43:49,360 --> 00:43:51,600
Even if it's planned,
it's not necessarily fake.

408
00:43:51,680 --> 00:43:54,520
Even if you're discussing marriage,
it might still not be true love.

409
00:43:56,000 --> 00:43:58,040
He is my boss.

410
00:43:59,000 --> 00:44:02,280
When I joined the company,
he asked me to quit on my first day.

411
00:44:02,360 --> 00:44:04,080
I was very nervous back then.

412
00:44:07,880 --> 00:44:10,840
I felt that he wasn't joking
when he said that.

413
00:44:10,920 --> 00:44:11,880
Did you offend him?

414
00:44:13,800 --> 00:44:15,200
Then I'm sure he is interested in you.

415
00:44:15,760 --> 00:44:17,400
I don't think so.

416
00:44:18,120 --> 00:44:20,240
He doesn't seem like someone
who lacks girlfriends.

417
00:44:22,280 --> 00:44:25,240
In his eyes, I'm probably

418
00:44:27,040 --> 00:44:29,440
a person made up entirely of flaws.

419
00:44:30,520 --> 00:44:34,080
I should probably focus
on how to survive in Lime.
